1
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:37,730
Why is he here?

2
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:40,630
Is he going to capture me
for a sacrifice again?

3
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:44,560
Little one, I'm here to pick you up.

4
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,700
P-P-Pick me up?

5
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,260
Exactly.

6
00:00:49,830 --> 00:00:50,630
Wait a minute.

7
00:00:50,930 --> 00:00:51,760
Shouldn't you ask for my permission

8
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,400
before taking me away?

9
00:01:00,630 --> 00:01:02,130
The High Priest of the Demonic Cult

10
00:01:02,130 --> 00:01:03,560
sneaking into my Qi Residence

11
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,099
just to fight me for a woman?

12
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,130
So she is a woman.

13
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:08,990
No wonder she's so pretty.

14
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:11,030
That makes me even more interested in her.

15
00:01:11,030 --> 00:01:12,260
Let's have a duel.

16
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:13,490
The winner gets her.

17
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:15,860
You overestimate yourself.

18
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:19,560
I don't belong to anyone!

19
00:01:27,530 --> 00:01:28,630
Such a commotion.

20
00:01:29,060 --> 00:01:30,760
Is Mister going to be okay?

21
00:01:34,430 --> 00:01:36,960
I can't believe I'm worrying
about that jerk.

22
00:01:39,100 --> 00:01:40,130
M-Mister,

23
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,830
why are you suddenly here?

24
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:44,030
Where is Hong?

25
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,630
I drove him away.

26
00:01:54,030 --> 00:01:54,960
As for you,

27
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,600
you promised to stay.

28
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:58,120
Why did you run away again?

29
00:01:58,700 --> 00:01:59,430
And

30
00:02:01,330 --> 00:02:03,130
in such ugly men's clothes, too.

31
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,700
It seems I need to punish you properly.

32
00:02:16,630 --> 00:02:17,660
M-Mister...

33
00:02:27,730 --> 00:02:28,600
Master Yan.

34
00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:29,200
No,

35
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:30,400
Yanmo.

36
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,260
You must be suffering too.

37
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,160
Your internal organs are damaged.

38
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:36,800
Enjoy the pain of your body
being corroded.

39
00:02:40,430 --> 00:02:41,860
But your woman

40
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,820
is indeed quite interesting.

41
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:46,329
A woman who can make Yanmo so nervous.

42
00:02:46,630 --> 00:02:49,030
No wonder she is the chosen one
from heaven.

43
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:54,500
My Lady, are you still worrying
about the Sect Leader?

44
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:56,960
Commander Ye,

45
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,030
stop calling me My Lady.

46
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,000
Why?

47
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,330
Don't you like the Sect Leader?

48
00:03:07,530 --> 00:03:09,400
It's him who doesn't like me.

49
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:11,730
Back at the Black Wind Stronghold,

50
00:03:11,730 --> 00:03:13,430
he totally wanted me dead.

51
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,130
That's not true.

52
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:18,500
The Sect Leader just had
his own difficulties.

53
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:19,760
When you were kidnapped,

54
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:21,290
he was the most anxious one.

55
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:22,960
Later, when you were poisoned,

56
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:25,960
he stayed by your side
for three whole days and nights.

57
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,100
W-What?

58
00:03:29,130 --> 00:03:30,300
Are you saying

59
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:32,630
that Mister likes me?

60
00:03:35,230 --> 00:03:36,300
Master Yan is here.

61
00:03:37,530 --> 00:03:40,030
I'm really sorry about
what happened last time.

62
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:42,030
I have already dealt with that spy.

63
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,130
I am Bai Ze.

64
00:03:43,430 --> 00:03:44,690
A pleasure to meet you.

65
00:03:48,829 --> 00:03:50,000
Cut the crap.

66
00:03:51,030 --> 00:03:53,560
Yungong Pavilion claims
to know everything.

67
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,530
I asked you to investigate a woman,

68
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,600
so why is there still no news?

69
00:04:01,460 --> 00:04:02,790
Within the Five Realms,

70
00:04:03,030 --> 00:04:05,090
Yungong Pavilion knows everything.

71
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:07,660
But beyond the Five Realms,
it's hard to say.

72
00:04:07,830 --> 00:04:09,760
The person you want to investigate
is no ordinary human.

73
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,830
All I can say is,

74
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,160
whoever gets Akong,

75
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:16,630
gets the world.

76
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:20,760
Oh,

77
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:22,960
let's talk this out nicely.

78
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:23,830
Bastard!

79
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:25,260
Do you know

80
00:04:25,260 --> 00:04:27,400
how much danger
those words will bring her?

81
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,560
I warn you.

82
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:30,060
If you dare leak the news,

83
00:04:30,060 --> 00:04:31,230
I will end you.

84
00:04:31,730 --> 00:04:32,800
Fine, fine.

85
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,760
Remember my words.

86
00:04:40,530 --> 00:04:41,800
Whether the news spreads

87
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,130
depends on my mood.

88
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:46,090
Besides, I want that woman for myself too.

89
00:04:46,630 --> 00:04:48,730
Mr. Bai, a lady is asking to see you.

90
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,030
Let her in.

91
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:54,830
The butler said he is here.

92
00:04:55,159 --> 00:04:56,460
I must ask him to clarify

93
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:58,390
what Commander Ye said last night.

94
00:04:59,230 --> 00:05:00,260
Lady Akong,

95
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,290
you were looking for me?

96
00:05:04,730 --> 00:05:05,830
You know me?

97
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:07,600
Not only do I know you,

98
00:05:07,930 --> 00:05:08,960
but I also know you are here for

99
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,730
Young Master Yan of the Qi Manor.

100
00:05:10,730 --> 00:05:11,600
Follow me.

101
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:18,600
By the way, this is for you.

102
00:05:19,230 --> 00:05:20,160
What is this?

103
00:05:20,530 --> 00:05:21,530
A mirror.

104
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:24,000
It might help in times of danger.

105
00:05:24,030 --> 00:05:27,430
Consider it an apology
for the incident at Yungong Pavilion.

106
00:05:27,530 --> 00:05:29,400
How can a mirror help?

107
00:05:29,660 --> 00:05:31,530
But it is quite pretty.
